al nuclear prototype stage, record defense-electronics orders [Actual].\n\n**Step 2-3. Lynch Classification: Stalwart with Fast-Grower characteristics**\n- Revenue growth 11.0% 3-yr CAGR [Actual], EPS growth mid-teens.\n- Key Lynch check: can it sustain 10\u201315% EPS growth? Yes, via backlog and margins; risk is multiple, not business.\n\n**Step 2-4. Financial Strength Scorecard**\n| Metric | Value | Tag |\n|---|---|---|\n| Revenue 3-yr CAGR | 11.0% | [Actual] |\n| Operating margin FY25 / TTM | 18.1% / ~19.4% | [Actual] |\n| ROE (vendor) | 19.7% | [Aggregator] |\n| ROIC (approx) | ~16% | [Estimate] |\n| FCF margin TTM | 17.1% | [Estimate] |\n| FCF conversion TTM | 116% | [Actual/Arithmetic] |\n| Net debt/EBITDA (LT+current debt only) | ~1.3x | [Estimate] |\n| Net debt/EBITDA (incl. op leases) | ~1.7x | [Estimate] |\n| Piotroski F-Score | 8/9 | [Actual/Arithmetic] |\n| Accruals ratio | -0.031 | [Actual/Arithmetic] |\n| Verdict: **Excellent** | | |\n\n**Step 2-5. Capital Allocation Scorecard (/15)**\n| Item | Score |\n|---|---|\n| Buyback efficiency (shares -2.4%/yr 3-yr, no peak excess) | 2 |\n| M&A track record (no data in pack) | 1* |\n| Capex efficiency (incremental ROIC >20% implied) | 3 |\n| Mix rationality | 2 |\n| Guidance accuracy (raises; multi-quarter beats) | 3 |\n| **Subtotal** | 11 |\n| Insider ownership 0.37%: no bonus | 0 |\n| Insider net buy/sell: no data | 0 |\n| **Total** | **11/15 \u2013 Good** |\n\n\\* M&A data unavailable; score set at 1 as conservative.\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 2.5. INTANGIBLES-ADJUSTED FINANCIALS\n\n- R&D data not in pack: no capitalization adjustment performed [Unconfirmed].\n- SBC adjustment: FY25 SBC $0.022B [Actual]; TTM adjusted FCF = $0.625B - ~$0.022B \u2248 $0.603B [Estimate].\n- Operating lease capitalization: FY25 operating leases $0.210B [Actual]; if treated as debt, total debt = $0.758B LT + $0.200B current portion + $0.210B operating leases = $1.168B, matching vendor total debt [Actual/Arithmetic].\n- Adjusted Net De